        "TRAIN HARD.OWN YOUR STRENGTH.",
        "Iron Works is a no-frills strength gym tucked into a converted steelworks unit in Kelham Island. Free weights, real coaching, and a community that pushes each other to lift more than they thought possible.",
        "Independent Strength Gym — Sheffield"
      ]
    },
    {
      "top": 926,
      "height": 890,
      "kind": "stats",
      "label": "Built by lifters, for lifters",
      "cards": 3,
      "iconCards": 0,
      "hiddenAtLoad": false,
