      "figures": 0,
      "text": [
        "Coaches who lift alongside you",
        "Every coach at Iron Works trains here themselves. You're learning from people who compete, not just people who certify.",
        "Marcus Reid",
        "Competing powerlifter of 12 years and a British Powerlifting-accredited coach. Marcus built Iron Works after years of training in gyms that didn't take strength seriously.",
        "Aisha Bello",
        "Specialises in beginner foundations and post-injury return to training. Aisha has a background in sports rehabilitation and a knack for making technique clear and simple.",
        "Tom Hargreaves",
        "Runs our small group sessions and remote programming. Tom competed in strongman for six years and brings that same event-based conditioning into general strength work.",
        "Meet The Team",
        "Head Coach & Founder"
      ]
    },
