      "text": [
        "What our members say",
        "\"I'd never touched a barbell before walking in. Eighteen months on I've pulled a 130kg deadlift and actually look forward to leg day. The coaching here is worth every penny.\"",
        "\"No mirrors full of people taking selfies, no queue for equipment. Just a proper gym with proper kit. Marcus and the team know every regular by name.\"",
        "\"Tom's remote programming got me from a 90kg squat to competing at my first meet within a year. Honest feedback, quick replies, and he actually watches every video.\"",
